WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.703
-This is our third show
back in the studio,

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.905
and my third show surrounded
by actual human beings

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.206
which is great because it means

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:10.609
I no longer need
to talk to inanimate objects

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:14.080
like I did when I was in my
attic or the captain's quarters.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.814
-Hey, Seth.
-Oh, no!

00:00:15.814 --> 00:00:17.383
You got the Prock doll

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.919
from the animated series,
"The Awesomes," that I voiced?

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.854
You can talk, too?
-Yeah, I can.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.589
And I've been in touch
with the sea captain.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:24.590
-Uh-huh.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.192
-He wanted me to ask you
a question.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:29.429
-Is it a real question,
or like a dumb sea-based pun?

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.363
-What did
the mythical sea creature say

00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:33.899
when he got to the party?
-Uh, I don't know.

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:36.803
-What's "crackin'"? [Kraken]
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:39.406
"Awesomes," all three seasons
available to stream on Hulu.

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:43.909
-I want everyone here to stop
talking to the sea Captain.

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:46.346
He's a bad influence, and
speaking of bad influences...

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:51.150
-Uh-hah! Awesome segue, Seth!
-Thank you, microphone.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.719
The president confessed on tape
that he knew about the severity

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:56.789
of the coronavirus pandemic
and lied to the American people.

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:59.758
And you'll never guess how
Republicans are reacting --

00:00:59.758 --> 00:01:01.994
they're pretending
they haven't heard about it.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.730
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.534 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.703
Obviously
it's hard to keep track

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.940
of all the grotesque criminality
and sociopathic incompetence

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.409
of the Trump administration
on any given day.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.679
It's like trying to follow all
the timelines on "Westworld."

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.180
I thought that was the past?

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.515
No, that was the future.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.217
And I thought that guy
was a human?

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:26.952
No, he's a robot. He just
got out of his milk bath.

00:01:26.952 --> 00:01:29.189
Just in the last 24 hours,

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.424
we've learned that Trump's
Department of Homeland Security

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.727
censored intelligence on Russian
meddling in the 2020 election,

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.464
downplayed the threat
of white supremacist terrorism,

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:40.700
and distorted evidence to match
Trump's lies about antifa,

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.203
the health department
tried to muzzle the government's

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.905
top infectious disease expert
and prevent him from warning

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:49.342
the public about the dangers
coronavirus poses to children,

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:52.311
and on top of all that,
the president admitted on tape

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.813
months ago that he knew
the coronavirus was deadly

00:01:54.813 --> 00:01:57.950
and airborne and confessed
that he was lying

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.819
when he downplayed the threat
of a dangerous

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:01.520
and highly infectious disease.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.089
Or as Fox News put it...

00:02:04.089 --> 00:02:05.324
-Good evening, everybody.

00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:07.793
President Trump today
had a great day --

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:11.530
a day that any president
could only dream of.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:14.133
-Oh, hey, look, everybody,
it's Baghdad Blob.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.601
I've heard of brown nosing,
but apparently,

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:18.004
Dobbs is in there so deep,
his hair turned brown.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:20.005
