"Grandpa, Harry Truman is dead!"

00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:26.679
But, hey, if I'm gonna believe
anyone, it's the guy

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:29.381
who combs his hair like
a 5-year-old at a wedding.

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:31.117
