to hold the rings.

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:35.688
[ Normal voice ] These guys
are all such creepy weirdos.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.690
They're like Stepford pundits.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.391
Dobbs talks like a guy
who just got through

00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:41.694
with six hours
of electroshock therapy.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:45.164
But even the Fox News reality
distortion machine couldn't hide

00:02:45.164 --> 00:02:49.369
