in the president's own words.

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:52.505
Let's just remember, this is
what Trump was saying publicly

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:55.107
as a deadly virus
was spreading across the world

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:56.708
