Americans' lives.

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:59.345
-It's going to disappear.
One day, it's like a miracle.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:00.580
It will disappear.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.449
The virus, they're working hard.

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.417
Looks like by April,
you know, in theory,

00:03:05.417 --> 00:03:08.387
