it miraculously goes away.

00:03:08.387 --> 00:03:09.354
I hope that's true.

00:03:09.354 --> 00:03:11.123
Now, the virus that we're

00:03:11.123 --> 00:03:13.993
talking about having to do --
you know, a lot of people think

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.630
that goes away in April with
the heat, as the heat comes in.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.032
Typically,
that will go away in April.

00:03:20.032 --> 00:03:23.102
China is very professionally run
in the sense

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.870
that they have everything
under control.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.438
I really believe they are
going to have it

00:03:26.438 --> 00:03:28.174
under control fairly soon.

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:31.110
You know, in April, supposedly,
it dies with the hotter weather.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.546
And that's a beautiful date
to look forward to.

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:38.685
We're working very strongly
with China on the coronavirus.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:42.388
That's a new thing that a lot
of people are talking about.

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:45.091
-"That's a new thing that a lot
of people are talking about."

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:47.326
And by the way, you don't
look like the guy I go to

00:03:47.326 --> 00:03:49.795
