00:06:22.214 --> 00:06:23.616
which he definitely would have,

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:26.252
it still would have helped
encourage more of his supporters

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:27.553
to take the virus seriously.

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:29.921
Instead, while he was
privately confessing

00:06:29.921 --> 00:06:32.591
that he knew coronavirus
was much deadlier than the flu,

00:06:32.591 --> 00:06:35.627
