00:07:07.493 --> 00:07:09.562
You take a solid flu vaccine.

00:07:09.562 --> 00:07:11.029
You don't think that would have
an impact

00:07:11.029 --> 00:07:12.799
or much of an impact on corona?

00:07:18.136 --> 00:07:19.872
-[ Chuckling ] It's such
a bummer that Trump

00:07:19.872 --> 00:07:21.640
