00:07:25.377 --> 00:07:27.613
[ As Trump ] Maybe the flu
vaccine would work?

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:29.682
[ Normal voice ] No.
[ As Trump ] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:07:29.682 --> 00:07:31.650
Because it's separate.
'Cause it's two separate things.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.252
I was just testing you.
Knew that, as well.

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.820
[ Normal voice ] And if you're
