00:07:54.473 --> 00:07:56.309
-Oh, you didn't want
to create a panic?

00:07:56.309 --> 00:07:57.676
Well, congrats, dude,
you nailed it.

00:07:57.676 --> 00:07:59.378
For the last six months,
