00:08:20.399 --> 00:08:23.936
I'd lost my capacity to be
shocked, but this one got me.

00:08:23.936 --> 00:08:26.806
I was mostly shocked that he was
dumb enough to confess something

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:30.175
